@startuml
title Sequo API - Rider Realtime Mission Offer Flow

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "SequoRider App" as RiderApp
participant "WebSocket /ws" as WS
participant "Presence Service" as Presence
participant "Delivery Mission Service" as Mission
participant "DeliveryAssignmentPolicy" as Assignment
participant "RiderRadarRealtimeService" as Radar
participant "FCM Push Gateway" as FCM
database "delivery_missions" as MissionsDb

RiderApp -> WS : CONNECT + JWT
WS -> Presence : mark rider AVAILABLE\nzone + device + app family

Mission -> Assignment : select eligible courier\nsubscriber priority if needed
Assignment --> Mission : selected rider or unassigned
Mission -> MissionsDb : create/offer mission\nstatus OFFERED_TO_COURIER
Mission -> Radar : publish mission offer event

alt Rider active over WebSocket
  Radar -> WS : /user/queue/mission-offers
  WS -> RiderApp : mission offer payload\nsafe pickup/dropoff zones
else Rider backgrounded
  Radar -> FCM : high priority FCM push\nmission offer
end

RiderApp -> Mission : REST accept mission\nIdempotency-Key
Mission -> MissionsDb : status ACCEPTED_BY_COURIER
Mission -> Radar : publish accepted update
Radar -> WS : /topic/delivery-missions/{missionId}

note right of Radar
Before rider accepts, payload must not include
full customer address or phone number.
end note

@enduml
